# bat — a cat replacement with syntax highlighting
# https://github.com/sharkdp/bat
#
# Usage is identical to cat: bat file.txt, echo "hi" | bat
# These flags apply to every bat invocation.

# Catppuccin Macchiato theme (matches our starship/delta/terminal theme)
# Install: bat cache --build (after stow links the theme files)
--theme="Catppuccin Macchiato"

# Show line numbers and git changes in the gutter, plus a filename header
--style="numbers,changes,header"

# Use italic for comments/strings (if your terminal font supports it)
--italic-text=always
